{"title":"Career Roadmap · Securities Lawyer","role":"Securities Lawyer","summary":"A Securities Lawyer advises companies, investors, financial institutions, investment funds and other market participants on laws and regulations governing securities, capital markets, public offerings, fundraising, listed companies, disclosures, investment transactions and market conduct.","facts":{"Current degree":"Law - LLB / BA LLB / BBA LLB / B.Com LLB / B.Sc LLB (Integrated)","Course":"Competition Law / Securities Law"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Securities Lawyer advises companies, investors, financial institutions, investment funds and other market participants on laws and regulations governing securities, capital markets, public offerings, fundraising, listed companies, disclosures, investment transactions and market conduct."},{"type":"p","text":"For a student combining Competition Law / Securities Law, the strongest positioning is toward capital markets, corporate transactions, financial regulation and securities compliance, while competition-law knowledge adds value in transactions involving market concentration, mergers, acquisitions and regulatory scrutiny."},{"type":"p","text":"Typical work includes:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Securities-law research"},{"text":"Capital-market transactions"},{"text":"IPO and public-offering support"},{"text":"Private placements"},{"text":"Debt securities"},{"text":"Equity transactions"},{"text":"Listing and disclosure compliance"},{"text":"Corporate governance"},{"text":"Investment-fund transactions"},{"text":"M&A regulatory analysis"},{"text":"Insider-trading compliance"},{"text":"Market-abuse risk"},{"text":"Regulatory correspondence"},{"text":"Due diligence"},{"text":"Transaction documentation"},{"text":"Securities-dispute support"}]},{"type":"note","label":"Professional qualification note","text":"“Securities Lawyer” is an employment/practice designation. Where the role involves legal practice or representation, applicable professional enrolment and regulatory requirements must be satisfied."}]},{"heading":"Career Pathway","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["Class 12","LLB / BA LLB / BBA LLB / B.Com LLB / B.Sc LLB","Securities / Capital Markets Law","Corporate / Securities Law Internships","Legal Research + Transaction Documentation","Junior Associate","Securities Lawyer / Capital Markets Associate","Senior Associate","Managing / Principal Associate","Counsel / Practice Lead","Partner / Head – Capital Markets"]},{"type":"h","text":"Alternative in-house pathway"},{"type":"flow","items":["Law Degree","Securities / Compliance","Investment Bank / Listed Company / Fund","Legal & Compliance Associate","Senior Legal Counsel","Capital Markets Counsel","Head Legal / General Counsel"]}]},{"heading":"What Does a Securities Lawyer Do?","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A securities lawyer operates at the intersection of:"},{"type":"p","text":"SECURITIES LAW"},{"type":"p","text":"│"},{"type":"p","text":"┌─────────────────────┼─────────────────────┐"},{"type":"p","text":"↓ ↓ ↓"},{"type":"p","text":"CAPITAL MARKETS CORPORATE REGULATION"},{"type":"p","text":"│ │ │"},{"type":"p","text":"IPO Governance Disclosure"},{"type":"p","text":"FPO Board Matters Compliance"},{"type":"p","text":"Debt Shareholders Market Conduct"},{"type":"p","text":"Bonds M&A Investigations"},{"type":"p","text":"│ │ │"},{"type":"flow","items":["└─────────────────────┼─────────────────────┘","INVESTOR PROTECTION"]},{"type":"p","text":"Depending on the employer, the lawyer may work on transactions or regulatory/compliance matters."}]},{"heading":"Why Competition Law + Securities Law Is Valuable","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Securities and competition law can intersect in major corporate transactions."},{"type":"p","text":"For example:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Mergers and acquisitions"},{"text":"Takeovers"},{"text":"Market concentration"},{"text":"Investment transactions"},{"text":"Listed-company acquisitions"},{"text":"Corporate restructuring"},{"text":"Platform/technology transactions"},{"text":"Financial-market competition"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A student who understands both areas can evaluate:"},{"type":"p","text":"How will a transaction affect investors, securities markets, competitors and regulatory authorities?"},{"type":"p","text":"This creates a strong interdisciplinary profile."}]},{"heading":"What You Learn During UG","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Legal & Business Foundations"},{"type":"h","text":"Legal foundation"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Constitutional law"},{"text":"Contract law"},{"text":"Law of torts"},{"text":"Legal methods"},{"text":"Legal reasoning"},{"text":"Legal research"},{"text":"Legal writing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Business foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"Particularly important for securities law:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Accounting"},{"text":"Economics"},{"text":"Business management"},{"text":"Corporate finance"},{"text":"Financial markets"},{"text":"Business communication"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Financial literacy"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Revenue"},{"text":"Profit"},{"text":"Assets"},{"text":"Liabilities"},{"text":"Equity"},{"text":"Debt"},{"text":"Cash flow"},{"text":"Capital structure"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Corporate Law Foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a strong company-law foundation."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Company formation"},{"text":"Share capital"},{"text":"Shares"},{"text":"Debentures"},{"text":"Directors"},{"text":"Board powers"},{"text":"Shareholders"},{"text":"Corporate governance"},{"text":"Related-party transactions"},{"text":"Corporate restructuring"},{"text":"Corporate filings"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Understand corporate structure"},{"type":"flow","items":["Shareholders","Board of Directors","Management","Business Operations","Financial Reporting","Regulatory Disclosure"]},{"type":"p","text":"This becomes essential when advising listed companies."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2–3 — Securities Law"},{"type":"p","text":"Study the major components of securities regulation."},{"type":"h","text":"Core areas"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Securities markets"},{"text":"Equity securities"},{"text":"Debt securities"},{"text":"Public offerings"},{"text":"Private placements"},{"text":"Listing"},{"text":"Disclosure"},{"text":"Corporate actions"},{"text":"Takeovers"},{"text":"Insider trading"},{"text":"Market manipulation"},{"text":"Investor protection"},{"text":"Market intermediaries"},{"text":"Securities enforcement"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Capital-market ecosystem"},{"type":"p","text":"Company"},{"type":"p","text":"│"},{"type":"p","text":"├── Investors"},{"type":"p","text":"│"},{"type":"p","text":"├── Stock Exchange"},{"type":"p","text":"│"},{"type":"p","text":"├── Securities Regulator"},{"type":"p","text":"│"},{"type":"p","text":"├── Merchant Banker / Advisors"},{"type":"p","text":"│"},{"type":"p","text":"├── Depository / Intermediaries"},{"type":"p","text":"│"},{"type":"p","text":"└── Legal Counsel"},{"type":"p","text":"A securities lawyer often coordinates with several of these stakeholders."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Public Offerings & IPOs"},{"type":"p","text":"IPO work is one of the most recognizable securities-law practice areas."},{"type":"h","text":"Broad IPO lifecycle"},{"type":"flow","items":["Company Decision","Pre-IPO Structuring","Due Diligence","Regulatory Analysis","Offer Documentation","Regulatory Review","Investor Marketing / Roadshow","Pricing / Allocation","Listing","Post-Listing Compliance"]},{"type":"h","text":"Lawyer's responsibilities"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Legal due diligence"},{"text":"Corporate records review"},{"text":"Material-contract review"},{"text":"Litigation review"},{"text":"Regulatory compliance"},{"text":"Offer-document verification"},{"text":"Risk-factor review"},{"text":"Disclosure analysis"},{"text":"Transaction documentation"},{"text":"Coordination with advisors"}]}]},{"heading":"Securities Due Diligence","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A securities lawyer must be able to identify material legal risks."},{"type":"h","text":"Due-diligence areas"},{"type":"table","header":["Area","Review"],"rows":[[{"text":"Corporate"},{"text":"Incorporation, ownership, governance"}],[{"text":"Contracts"},{"text":"Material agreements"}],[{"text":"Litigation"},{"text":"Pending and potential disputes"}],[{"text":"Regulatory"},{"text":"Licences and approvals"}],[{"text":"Employment"},{"text":"Key employment matters"}],[{"text":"IP"},{"text":"Ownership and licensing"}],[{"text":"Tax"},{"text":"Tax disputes and obligations"}],[{"text":"Securities"},{"text":"Prior issuances and compliance"}],[{"text":"Debt"},{"text":"Financing arrangements"}],[{"text":"Related Parties"},{"text":"Transactions and disclosures"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Workflow"},{"type":"flow","items":["Documents","Legal Review","Issue Identification","Materiality Assessment","Risk Classification","Disclosure Analysis","Due-Diligence Report"]}]},{"heading":"Corporate Disclosures","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Listed companies operate under extensive disclosure obligations."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn to understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Material information"},{"text":"Financial disclosures"},{"text":"Corporate announcements"},{"text":"Shareholding disclosures"},{"text":"Related-party disclosures"},{"text":"Governance disclosures"},{"text":"Corporate actions"},{"text":"Investor communications"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The lawyer's role is often to ensure that disclosures are legally appropriate, accurate and properly documented."}]},{"heading":"Insider Trading & Market Conduct","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Understand the concepts surrounding:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Unpublished price-sensitive information"},{"text":"Insider classification"},{"text":"Trading restrictions"},{"text":"Trading windows"},{"text":"Disclosure obligations"},{"text":"Information barriers"},{"text":"Confidentiality"},{"text":"Market manipulation"},{"text":"Front-running"},{"text":"Fraudulent market activity"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Compliance workflow"},{"type":"flow","items":["Sensitive Information","Identify Relevant Persons","Restrict Access","Maintain Records","Monitor Transactions","Review Disclosures","Investigate Potential Breach","Regulatory Response"]},{"type":"p","text":"Exact regulatory requirements should always be checked against the current rules applicable to the organization and transaction."}]},{"heading":"Debt Securities & Corporate Finance","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Securities lawyers can also work on debt transactions."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn about:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Bonds"},{"text":"Debentures"},{"text":"Notes"},{"text":"Debt issuance"},{"text":"Security interests"},{"text":"Covenants"},{"text":"Credit arrangements"},{"text":"Institutional investors"},{"text":"Rating concepts"},{"text":"Disclosure"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Debt transaction"},{"type":"flow","items":["Issuer","Transaction Structuring","Due Diligence","Documentation","Regulatory Compliance","Investor Participation","Issuance","Ongoing Obligations"]}]},{"heading":"Private Equity & Venture Capital","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Securities-law knowledge is highly relevant to investment transactions."},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Equity investments"},{"text":"Convertible instruments"},{"text":"Share subscriptions"},{"text":"Shareholders' agreements"},{"text":"Investor rights"},{"text":"Board rights"},{"text":"Reserved matters"},{"text":"Pre-emption"},{"text":"Tag-along"},{"text":"Drag-along"},{"text":"Anti-dilution"},{"text":"Exit rights"},{"text":"Liquidation preferences"}]},{"type":"h","text":"PE/VC transaction"},{"type":"flow","items":["Investor","Term Sheet","Due Diligence","Valuation / Negotiation","Investment Documentation","Regulatory Review","Signing","Closing","Post-Investment Governance"]}]},{"heading":"M&A + Competition Law","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The competition-law specialization adds particular value to M&A practice."},{"type":"h","text":"Transaction analysis"},{"type":"flow","items":["Proposed Transaction","Corporate Analysis","Securities Analysis","Competition Analysis","Regulatory Approvals","Transaction Documentation","Closing"]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn concepts such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Market definition"},{"text":"Market share"},{"text":"Competitive effects"},{"text":"Horizontal transactions"},{"text":"Vertical transactions"},{"text":"Conglomerate transactions"},{"text":"Merger control"},{"text":"Regulatory approval"},{"text":"Remedies"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The precise regulatory thresholds and filing requirements should always be checked under the current applicable framework."}]},{"heading":"Financial Statement Literacy","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A securities lawyer does not need to become an accountant, but must understand financial statements."},{"type":"h","text":"Balance Sheet"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Assets"},{"text":"Liabilities"},{"text":"Equity"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Income Statement"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Revenue"},{"text":"Expenses"},{"text":"EBITDA"},{"text":"EBIT"},{"text":"Profit"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Cash Flow"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Operating"},{"text":"Investing"},{"text":"Financing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Capital structure"},{"type":"p","text":"COMPANY CAPITAL"},{"type":"p","text":"│"},{"type":"p","text":"┌──────────┴──────────┐"},{"type":"p","text":"↓ ↓"},{"type":"p","text":"DEBT EQUITY"},{"type":"p","text":"│ │"},{"type":"p","text":"Loans / Bonds Shares"},{"type":"p","text":"Debentures Investors"},{"type":"p","text":"This allows the lawyer to understand the commercial implications of legal transactions."}]},{"heading":"Projects During UG","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Mock IPO"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a fictional company preparing for an IPO."},{"type":"p","text":"Prepare:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Corporate profile"},{"text":"Legal due diligence"},{"text":"Material contracts"},{"text":"Litigation summary"},{"text":"Regulatory checklist"},{"text":"Risk factors"},{"text":"Disclosure checklist"},{"text":"Closing checklist"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Securities Compliance Tracker"},{"type":"p","text":"Build an Excel/Power BI dashboard tracking:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Regulatory obligations"},{"text":"Filing dates"},{"text":"Disclosure requirements"},{"text":"Corporate actions"},{"text":"Responsible person"},{"text":"Status"},{"text":"Evidence"},{"text":"Escalation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — M&A Regulatory Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Take a fictional acquisition and evaluate:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Corporate structure"},{"text":"Securities implications"},{"text":"Competition issues"},{"text":"Investor impact"},{"text":"Regulatory approvals"},{"text":"Disclosure requirements"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — Insider Trading Compliance Framework"},{"type":"p","text":"Design a fictional company's framework for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sensitive information"},{"text":"Restricted persons"},{"text":"Access controls"},{"text":"Trading restrictions"},{"text":"Disclosure"},{"text":"Monitoring"},{"text":"Investigations"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — Securities Legal Research Database"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a database containing:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Case"},{"text":"Legal issue"},{"text":"Regulation"},{"text":"Facts"},{"text":"Decision"},{"text":"Regulatory principle"},{"text":"Market impact"},{"text":"Practical implication"}]}]},{"heading":"Internship Strategy","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Securities-law students should prioritize transaction-heavy and financial-regulatory environments."},{"type":"h","text":"High-value internships"},{"type":"table","header":["Internship","Value"],"rows":[[{"text":"Capital Markets Law Firm"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Securities Law Practice"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Investment Banking Legal Team"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Listed Company Legal Team"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Securities/Financial Regulation"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"M&A Practice"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"PE/VC Practice"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Banking & Finance"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Competition Law"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Stock Exchange / Market Institution"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Financial Services Compliance"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Legal-Tech / RegTech"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Suggested progression"},{"type":"h","text":"Year 1"},{"type":"p","text":"Legal research + corporate law basics"},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2"},{"type":"p","text":"Corporate/commercial law internship"},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3"},{"type":"p","text":"Securities/capital markets internship"},{"type":"h","text":"Final Year"},{"type":"p","text":"Capital markets / M&A / financial-regulatory internship"}]},{"heading":"Employer Skill Matrix","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Employer","High-Value Skills"],"rows":[[{"text":"Capital Markets Law Firm"},{"text":"Securities + transactions"}],[{"text":"Investment Bank"},{"text":"Capital markets + finance"}],[{"text":"Listed Company"},{"text":"Securities compliance + governance"}],[{"text":"PE/VC Fund"},{"text":"Investment documentation"}],[{"text":"Stock Exchange"},{"text":"Market regulation"}],[{"text":"Financial Regulator"},{"text":"Securities regulation + policy"}],[{"text":"Corporate Law Firm"},{"text":"M&A + securities"}],[{"text":"Banking Legal Team"},{"text":"Finance + securities"}],[